  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The hardness and break DC of any objects in your <em>pathing</em> is reduced by 3, plus an additional 1 for every 4 ranks you possess in an associated sphere. Additionally, allies may use the blaze a trail action from the Survival skill as part of a move action when moving through your <em>pathing</em>, and may do so untrained. Such allies may use your ranks in one of your associated skills in place of their ranks in Survival for the purpose of blazing a trail.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/navigation#toc43\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
